# Package only what the extension needs at runtime, plus the docs.
# README images use relative links: they render on GitHub, and on the Marketplace once a `repository`
# is configured (vsce then rewrites them to absolute URLs), so the image files aren't packaged.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!dist/extension.js
!dist/webview/controlPanel.js
!dist/webview/sound.js
!media/icons/**
!media/styles/**
# Brand logos shown in the Control Panel's About tab (dark and light theme variants).
!media/logo/Full_Logo.png
!media/logo/Light_Background_application.png
